// P3C.5 / D12, Ex2 Universal Joint Assembly Drawing (intro-to-drawings.md D11, D12, ex2-step1..11,
// target ex2-drawing.png) on the stand-in assembly (`cadrs_core::samples::ujoint_assembly`,
// `fixtures/ujoint_assembly_standin.cadrs`: 2 flanges, the centre block, 4 bushes, 4 axles and 16
// pan head machine screws 1/4-28 x 0.75, the course's Part numbers and Descriptions). Sheet points
// are `world(x, y)` in sheet mm on the ANSI A (inch) sheet; the isometric view's model origin (the
// first flange's floor centre) is at (64, 96): the view is placed by its middle, at (64, 134.886),
// left of the BOM table (the table is opaque).
// 01 (ex2-step1, D12.1) the copied stand-in: the Universal Joint Assembly tab.
// 02 (ex2-step2, D12.2) the BOM panel: Add column → Name; 03 its header menu: Move left, until
//    it is next to Item.
// 03c (D1.2) a screw's right-click menu (its list row): "Create Drawing of Pan head machine screw
//    1/4-28 x 0.75…" (the part, not its Standard content studio); 03d the Create Drawing dialog it
//    opens on that part; cancelled.
// 04 (ex2-step3, D12.3) "+" → Create Drawing…; 05 (ex2-step4, D12.4) ANSI_A_INCH.dwt.
// 06 (ex2-step5, D12.5) Insert view → Assemblies → Universal Joint Assembly, Isometric, 1:2,
//    following the cursor; 07 placed (Projected view ended).
// 08 (ex2-step6, D12.6) the tab renamed "Universal Joint Assembly Drawing".
// 09 (ex2-step7, D12.7) Show shaded view, Tangent edges → Phantom.
// 10 (ex2-step8, D12.8) Insert BOM: Flattened, Top to bottom, fixed corner top right; the table
//    (its columns sized to their content, nearly the frame's width as in ex2-step8; opaque, so the
//    view's lines don't show through it) follows the cursor, snapped to the border's top-right
//    corner; 11 placed. 11b (D11.3) its right-click menu: BOM Table properties…; 11c the card with
//    Order → Bottom to top, previewed live on the table; 11d applied (the header at the bottom,
//    the rows from the bottom up); 11e the card again, back to Top to bottom (previewed), then ✓.
// 12 (ex2-step9, D12.9) the table selected, its left midpoint grip dragged right (narrower: the
//    cells wrap between words only, and no column gets narrower than its longest word, so
//    "Quantity" and "MSB-0001xC" stay whole); 12b the Part number | Description line dragged
//    where it meets the top edge (Part number wider, Description narrower); 13 released.
// 14 (ex2-step10, D12.10) Callout: Underline, centre Part: Name, right "x " + Table: Qty. (the
//    card shows the property fields as chips); the first part picked, the callout following the
//    cursor (its leader's arrowhead sized to the text); 15 the five callouts placed.
// 16 (ex2-step11, D12.11) a callout dragged into line: the dashed inference line.
// 16b (D11.5) the axle's callout: right-click → Edit…; 16c the Callout card with its fields, the
//    lower one given Part: Part number (the callout previews "MSB-0003" under its line); 16d ✓;
//    then undone (Ctrl+Z), as the course's drawing has no part numbers on its callouts.
// 17 the finished drawing (ex2-drawing.png).
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        Wait(10),
        Custom("fixture ujoint_assembly_standin"),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("tab-universal-joint-assembly")),
        Wait(40),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(30),
        MoveTo(1500, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-assembly"),
        // D12.2: Add column → Name, Move left until it is next to Item.
        Click(ui("panel-bom")),
        Wait(15),
        Click(ui("bom-add-column")),
        Wait(5),
        Hover(ui("bom-add-col-2")),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("02-bom-add-column-name"),
        Click(ui("bom-add-col-2")),
        Wait(8),
        RightClick(ui("bom-header-col-4")),
        Wait(5),
        Hover(ui("bom-move-left")),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-bom-move-left"),
        Click(ui("bom-move-left")),
        Wait(8),
        RightClick(ui("bom-header-col-3")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("bom-move-left")),
        Wait(8),
        RightClick(ui("bom-header-col-2")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("bom-move-left")),
        Wait(8),
        MoveTo(1500, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03b-bom-name-next-to-item"),
        // D1.2: a screw's menu (its list row; the view click at (575, 550) landed on a flange,
        // Final part 4) → Create Drawing of the part.
        RightClick(ui("instance-row-12")),
        WaitFor("asm-drawing"),
        Hover(ui("asm-drawing")),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("03c-instance-menu-create-drawing"),
        Click(ui("asm-drawing")),
        WaitFor("create-drawing-dialog"),
        Wait(8),
        MoveTo(1400, 950),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03d-create-drawing-of-instance"),
        Click(ui("create-drawing-cancel")),
        Wait(8),
        Key("Escape"),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("panel-bom")),
        Wait(10),
        // D12.3, D12.4: "+" → Create Drawing… → ANSI_A_INCH.
        Click(ui("insert-tab")),
        WaitFor("create-drawing"),
        Hover(ui("create-drawing")),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("04-plus-menu-create-drawing"),
        Click(ui("create-drawing")),
        WaitFor("create-drawing-dialog"),
        Wait(8),
        Click(ui("template-filter-1")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("template-row-ANSI_A_INCH.dwt")),
        Wait(5),
        MoveTo(1400, 950),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("05-create-drawing-ansi-a-inch"),
        Click(ui("create-drawing-ok")),
        WaitFor("insert-view-dialog"),
        Wait(15),
        // D12.5: the assembly, Isometric, 1:2.
        Click(ui("insert-view-kind-tabs-1")),
        Wait(8),
        Click(ui("browser-assembly-1")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("insert-view-orientation")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("insert-view-orientation-option-6")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("insert-view-scale")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("insert-view-scale-option-1")),
        Wait(5),
        MoveWorld(64, 134),
        Wait(40),
        MoveWorld(64, 134.886),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("06-insert-view-assembly-iso-1-2"),
        ClickWorld(64, 134.886),
        Wait(40),
        Key("Escape"),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1500, 960),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("07-view-placed"),
        // D12.6: rename the tab.
        RightClick(ui("tab-drawing-1")),
        WaitFor("tab-rename"),
        Click(ui("tab-rename")),
        Wait(5),
        Type("Universal Joint Assembly Drawing"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Wait(5),
        MoveTo(1500, 960),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("08-tab-renamed"),
        // D12.7: shaded, phantom tangent edges.
        RightClick(world(64, 140)),
        Wait(8),
        Click(ui("view-menu-shaded")),
        Wait(40),
        RightClick(world(64, 140)),
        Wait(5),
        Hover(ui("view-menu-tangent-edges")),
        Wait(8),
        Click(ui("view-menu-tangent-phantom")),
        Wait(30),
        MoveTo(1500, 960),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("09-shaded-phantom"),
        // D12.8: Insert BOM at the border's top-right corner.
        Click(ui("drawing-bom")),
        WaitFor("bom-dialog"),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("bom-dialog-corner-top-right")),
        Wait(5),
        MoveWorld(262, 199),
        Wait(10),
        MoveWorld(263, 200),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("10-insert-bom-snapped"),
        ClickWorld(263, 200),
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1500, 960),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("11-bom-placed"),
        // D11.3: BOM Table properties: Order → Bottom to top, and back.
        RightClick(world(150, 196)),
        WaitFor("table-menu-bom-properties"),
        Hover(ui("table-menu-bom-properties")),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("11b-bom-menu-properties"),
        Click(ui("table-menu-bom-properties")),
        WaitFor("bom-properties"),
        Wait(8),
        Click(ui("bom-order")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("bom-order-option-1")),
        Wait(8),
        MoveTo(1500, 960),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("11c-bom-properties-bottom-to-top"),
        Click(ui("bom-properties-ok")),
        Wait(15),
        MoveTo(1500, 960),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("11d-bom-bottom-to-top"),
        RightClick(world(150, 196)),
        WaitFor("table-menu-bom-properties"),
        Click(ui("table-menu-bom-properties")),
        WaitFor("bom-properties"),
        Wait(8),
        Click(ui("bom-order")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("bom-order-option-0")),
        Wait(8),
        MoveTo(1500, 960),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("11e-bom-properties-back-to-top-to-bottom"),
        Click(ui("bom-properties-ok")),
        Wait(15),
        // D12.9: the table selected, its left midpoint grip dragged right (narrower).
        Key("Escape"),
        Wait(3),
        ClickWorld(150, 196),
        Wait(8),
        Press(world(16.95, 182.2)),
        MoveWorld(30, 182.2),
        Wait(3),
        MoveWorld(80, 182.2),
        Wait(3),
        MoveWorld(100, 182.2),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("12-bom-left-grip-dragged"),
        Release,
        Wait(10),
        // A column width: the Part number | Description line right (dragged where it meets the
